## 🔄 SQL Workflow

```text
Cleaned Dataset
       ↓
Import Data into MySQL
       ↓
Create E-Commerce Sales Table
       ↓
Run SQL Queries
       ↓
Analyze Sales & Orders
       ↓
Generate Business Insights
```

